# This file is no longer needed!
# All configuration is handled through GitHub repository secrets.
# 
# Required GitHub Repository Secrets:
# - SNOWFLAKE_DEV_ACCOUNT
# - SNOWFLAKE_DEV_USERNAME  
# - SNOWFLAKE_DEV_PASSWORD
# - SNOWFLAKE_DEV_ROLE
#
# These are automatically passed as TF_VAR_* environment variables
# in the GitHub Actions workflows.